    <string name="detect_note">Impacts and harsh braking use horizontal force only, so potholes and speed bumps don\'t trigger. Image detection ignores headlights, flickering lights and small changes, and only starts an event when the motion sensors also feel something unusual. An event that started by itself ends automatically after the time you set (another impact extends it).</string>
